{
    "title": "LUDEX Sports Card Scanner +TCG",
    "description": "Easily identify, track, value, and sell your sports and trading card collection with Ludex. Instantly understand what you have and what it\u2019s worth. Ludex accurately scans, identifies, and prices out your collection in seconds, all while giving you the tools to buy and sell. The app allows you to manage your Baseball, Basketball, Football, Soccer, Hockey, MMA, Racing, Pokemon and Magic the Gathering cards. See who\u2019s trending, know who to sell and when to sell, giving you the opportunity to list on marketplaces\u2013 turning your cards into cash!  \r\n\r\nScan Your Sports Cards and Trading Cards\r\nUse our patent-pending AI technology to identify any card, from any era in a matter of seconds. We can help you decipher all of those difficult variations and parallels. Know what you have and what it\u2019s worth. \r\n\r\nValue Your Collection\r\nOur proprietary algorithms include sales data from the major sports and trading card marketplaces. \r\nWe help the collector stay up to speed with real time price updates on their entire collection. \r\n\r\nBuy and Sell Seamlessly \r\nBuy cards by browsing your favorite teams, players and sets. Use our \u201cList-It\u201d tool to easily sell your cards and make cash fast. \r\n\r\nBuild your Collection\r\nNo more spreadsheets, word documents, or notebooks. Ludex provides you with the proper tools to accommodate your collection. Use custom binders and specific filters to organize your collection based on your wants and needs. \r\n\r\nDiscover\r\nFollow trending sold players, discover what\u2019s happening in the hobby, and more with our discover page.\r\n\r\nWishlist\r\nCreate a list of cards that you're interested in. Keep an eye on their current and historical prices, and buy when the price is right with just one click.\r\n\r\nPlayer and Team Sets\r\nView your sets, see how close you are to completion, and continue to complete your card collecting goals. \r\n\r\nTCG Deck Building\r\nBuild out your favorite trading card game decks. We allow you to organize and build your decks with ease, making it effortless to plan your strategy for future competitions. \r\n \r\nSupported Trading Card and Sports Card Categories:\r\n\u2022 Sports cards: Baseball, Basketball, Football, Hockey, Soccer, MMA, Racing\r\n\u2022 TCG: Magic: the Gathering (MTG) and Pok\u00e9mon\r\n\r\nLudex Membership Plans\r\n\u2022 Free: Unlimited scans a month of any category and 60 added cards in your portfolio. Publish up to 5 eBay listings each month. \r\n\u2022 Lite: Unlimited scans, Collections, and Price Reports for one category. Publish up 50 eBay listings each month for $4.99/Month or $49.99/Year.\r\n\u2022 Standard: Unlimited scans, Collections, and Price Reports for any category. Publish up 50 eBay listings each month for $9.99/Month or $89.99/Year.\r\n\u2022 Pro Membership: Unlimited scans, Collections, and price reports for any category. Publish up to 250 eBay listings each month for $24.99/Month or $239.99/Year. \r\n\r\nRead the terms and conditions here:\r\nhttps://www.ludex.com/terms\r\n\r\nRead the privacy policy here:\r\nhttps://www.ludex.com/privacy-policy",
